# Python byte-compilation artifacts (CI runs `compileall` over plugins/)
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# Local census config and generated catalogs — these name real paths on the
# machine that produced them and must never reach this public repo.
.census.json
census.json
CENSUS.md

# Generated atlas viewers — same reason. atlas writes to the temp directory by
# default, so one landing here means someone passed --out on purpose.
claude-atlas*.html
atlas.html
